{"path":"container/flat_map/erase_if","title":"std::erase_if (std::flat_map)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>erase_if <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::flat_map)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_map/erase_if","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Erases all elements that satisfy the predicate pred from c.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/flat_map\">&lt;flat_map&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Key, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Compare, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> KeyContainer, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> MappedContainer,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Pred <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map\"><span class=\"kw3359\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Key, T, Compare, KeyContainer, MappedContainer<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">size_type</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; erase_if<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map\"><span class=\"kw3359\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Key, T, Compare, KeyContainer, MappedContainer<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> c,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pred pred <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Erases all elements that satisfy the predicate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code>.\n</p><p>The predicate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code> is satisfied if the expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>pred<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Key<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>e<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, where <code>e</code> is some element in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code>.\n</p><p><code>Key</code> and <code>T</code> must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/MoveAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">MoveAssignable</em></a>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> container adaptor from which to erase\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pred\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> predicate that returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the element should be erased\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of erased elements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Exactly <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> applications of the predicate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If <code>erase_if</code> throws, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> remains in valid but unspecified (maybe empty) state.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The algorithm is <i>stable</i>, that is, the order of elements that are not deleted remains unchanged.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;flat_map&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rem, <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> rem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'{'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span> sep<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"st0\">' '</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>key, value<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sep <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'{'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> key <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'}'</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>sep <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">','</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"}<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map\"><span class=\"kw3359\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> data\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'b'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'c'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'d'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'e'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'f'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'g'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'g'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Original:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, data<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> count <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector/erase2\"><span class=\"kw3237\">std::<span class=\"me2\">erase_if</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>data, <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> item<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>key, value<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> item<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>key <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Erase items with odd keys:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, data<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> count <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" items removed.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Original:\n{{1, a}, {2, b}, {3, c}, {4, d}, {5, e}}\nErase items with odd keys:\n{{2, b}, {4, d}}\n3 items removed.</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/remove\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>remove</span><span>remove_if</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes elements satisfying specific criteria <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/remove\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::remove</span><span>ranges::remove_if</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> removes elements satisfying specific criteria<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(algorithm function object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/flat_map","title":"std::flat_map"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::erase_if (std::flat_map)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Erases all elements that satisfy the predicate pred from c."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c, pred"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The number of erased elements."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Exactly c.size() applications of the predicate pred."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If erase_if throws, c remains in valid but unspecified (maybe empty) state."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The algorithm is stable, that is, the order of elements that are not deleted remains unchanged."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"remove, remove_if","note":"removes elements satisfying specific criteria"},{"label":"ranges::remove, ranges::remove_if","note":"removes elements satisfying specific criteria"}]}]},"standards":["C++20","C++23"],"wordCount":296,"codeBlockCount":2}
